  "price_level": 1,
  "rating": 4.8,
  "reference": "ChIJsRvSV21hwokRFnXOw76ysmU",
  "reviews": [
    {
      "author_name": "Bella Lu",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113204155917057274491/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWh01CsXyRrhSgopoKIp7L5GbPpLDcAXbCiMcT3Fph-UlWrCHGd=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
      "text": "Sweet Cake is such a hidden gem in Flushing! Their bakery items are so creative and different. Every dessert feels like something special. I’ve tried a few and they’ve all been super yummy, with unique flavors you don’t find everywhere.\n\nThey also have tons of boba tea options, which makes it the perfect one-stop spot for sweets and drinks. The space is cozy and cute, perfect for a little self-care chill time or a girl date with your bestie. Definitely one of my favorite dessert spots in the area. I’ll be back soon for sure!",
      "time": 1747185317,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "HSIN YI HUANG",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105027347780549399297/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIo_8aSBLkHvHPYdHEkJh-pqjoyi3yyUiRukiWsxt5SZs4BwQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
      "text": "Now they have special set meal~\n$8: a special danish bread+ egg tart +small coffee! It’s amazing combination!!!\n\nMy colleagues and friends like their eggs tarts very much. I always treat myself a bubble tea, makes myself happy!\n\nI bought 5 kinds of new danish breads, they are so delicious! Can’t wait to try the rest of them!",
      "time": 1745551711,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Valery Castro",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108489780010873218357/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDnHAUTSBLOfMtES7JDS3I3z1Cl9jClRpBA8UP-x0j2_BRjfpu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
      "text": "I always wanted to try this place out and today I finally had the chance. It succeeded my expectations! 😊The customer service was very good. I ordered a brown sugar milk tea and got a free sample! 👏🏼The prices are very reasonable especially with the high prices for drinks nowadays. I enjoyed the ambiance and will surely be back.🌸",
      "time": 1743016031,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Frugal Cyclist",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113148947611018822952/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5NDw-24s_KVtW0-9yKcF7Jx-PlYPFiNy2ADr_QJaTBxv77P9N=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7",
      "rating": 4,
      "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
      "text": "Nice bakery with fresh pastries 👍\n\nCycling 100 miles today and came here to refuel. Was welcomed in and advised to put my bike in the rear. 🙏🏻\n\nGot an Oolong tea as recommended. Enjoyed the Boba sugar bread & egg custard tart. Both excellent 😊.\n\nPROS:\n1) unique assortment of pastries\n2) baked fresh on premise\n3) reasonably priced cakes for $38\n4) ample seating\n5) polite & courteous\n\nCONS:\n1) egg custard tart was small in size\n2) ambiance can be upgraded to a lounge style seating\n3) can use some plants to liven up the space",
      "time": 1747691411,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Cheryl Woo",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107508462843467662936/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV3zxLhpdfcbp2ihyRgBJxDsu3DjkJY5iCVapnclZeoscwbUSOf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
      "text": "great spot to grab a quick bite whether you’re looking for savory or sweet. they also have a variety of drinks as well. inside is super spacious and located right in flushing!",
      "time": 1747763360,
      "translated": false
    }
  ],
